			"url": "https://github.com/outline/outline/discussions/2256#discussioncomment-928950",
			"summary": "A maintainer points to an older tags issue and says the team is holding off in favour of better search, because every extra organising step makes the product harder and the hierarchy already asks a lot; they invite concrete examples where tags would beat search.",
